# Unrestricted C atom: the aufbau puts the two 2p electrons in m=+1 and
# m=-1 (3Sigma_g-, M_L=0). HundBias fills +m before -m, giving the M_L=1
# component of 3P, 3Pi_g.
System C.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method lda_x-lda_c_vwn
Multiplicity 3
Restricted false
ComplexBasis true
JKMethod Cholesky
DFTGrid 75 -302
HundBias 0.01
SaveChk complex_orbs_c_hund.chk
